\title{Observations about spanning subgraphs}
\date{2026-10-09T02:37:29Z}
\tag{algorithms}
\taxon{Remark}

\import{algorithms-macros}

\p{A few observations about [spanning subgraphs](00OA):
\ul{
  \li{If #{G} is connected, then #{G} is a spanning subgraph of itself.}
  \li{If #{G} is disconnected, it has no spanning subgraph, because deleting edges can't make it connected.}
  \li{If a spanning subgraph of #{G} contains a cycle, then removing any edge from the cycle results in another spanning subgraph.}
}
}
